\title "A chord moves earlier or later by the grid"
\ts (4 4)
r.2{txt "**1.** Select Tab view\nTab, at the top left of the clip"}
  (5.1 3.2 4.3 5.4).16{txt "**2.** Move this chord a 16th earlier\nPress this 5, then Alt+← (Option+← on a Mac): it now starts a 16th before beat 3"}
  r.16 r.8 r.4 |
r.4
  (2.4 2.5 0.6).8{txt "**3.** Drag it later\nDrag this 0 to the right: the chord moves an 8th (its own length) at a time; let go"}
  r.8 r.2 |

